  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-07-18T11:04:09.301Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I think that there should be a section that people can choose from subject-based worlds, For example worlds created for Christians to mingle, worlds for political or religious discussion, world to talk about video games, current events, etc. it could have its own section the same way that there is a section for avatar worlds, community labs, etc. I think this would be a great idea so that people can at least have something to talk about or be able to mingle with like-minded people in certain worlds designed for specific topics and discussions as opposed to going to worlds where no one is really talking about anything but are just being silly a lot of the times.",
